  "rationale": "Raw reads recovered exactly from the deposited normalized table (reads times one scale per library plus a pseudocount of 1; prepare.R). Columns {n1m,utp,stbl}_{bri_2_5,bri_5,dim_5,dim_2_5,un}_{1,2} match the GSM titles (N1m / UTP / Stable-cell; Top 0-2.5%, Top 2.5-5%, Bottom 2.5-5%, Bottom 0-2.5%, unsorted input; rep 1/2); that '2_5' is the outer 0-2.5% bin is inferred from the names and supported by TRIM25 guides being more enriched in bri_2_5 than in bri_5. HCT116 Brunello KO cells were given LNP-delivered GFP mRNA (unmodified UTP or N1m-pseudouridine) and sorted on GFP. Suppressors of exogenous mRNA (TRIM25, N4BP1, KHNYN, ZAP) are enriched in the GFP-high bin; uptake and endosomal-escape factors (HSPG synthesis such as EXT1 and SLC35B2, V-ATPase) are enriched in the GFP-low bin. Each outer bin is compared with the unsorted input of the same mRNA (2 vs 2, 2 residual df); a replicate term would pair each sort with its own input but leave 1 residual df, so it is left out. The stable-GFP cell line is the paper's cellular control and is not analyzed.",
